Package: home-portal
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: hoknie <120724599+hoknie@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: ca-certificates
Homepage: https://github.com/hoknie/home-portal
Description: A start page for a home network that knows which services are up
 home-portal probes home services over HTTP, TCP and ICMP, keeps their history, shows a
 home page arranged in the browser, publishes services through Caddy and runs automations.
 One static binary with the interface embedded, run by systemd as the user home-portal.
